### 1. 正常登录 — 使用 id（纯数字 account）
POST http://localhost:8080/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "account": "5",
  "password": "123"
}

### 2. 正常登录 — 使用手机号
POST http://localhost:8080/user/login
Content-Type: application/json charset=UTF-8

{
  "account": "10000000001",
  "password": "123"
}

### 3. 错误密码
POST http://localhost:8080/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "account": "5",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

### 4. 用户不存在 — id 不存在
POST http://localhost:8080/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "account": "999999",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 5. 用户不存在 — 手机号不存在
POST http://localhost:8080/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "account": "19900000000",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 6. 缺少 account 字段
POST http://localhost:8080/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password": "123456"
}

### 7. 缺少 password 字段
POST http://localhost:8080/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "account": "5"
}

### 8. 空请求体
POST http://localhost:8080/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 9. account 格式错误 — 既不是手机号也不是纯数字
POST http://localhost:8080/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "account": "admin@abc",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 10. account 为长度超过15的纯数字（不满足 <15 条件）
POST http://localhost:8080/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "account": "12345678901234567890",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 11. password 为空字符串
POST http://localhost:8080/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "account": "5",
  "password": ""
}

### 12. account 为空字符串
POST http://localhost:8080/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "account": "",
  "password": "123456"
}

### ==================== 注册测试 (POST /user/register) ====================

### 13. 正常注册
POST http://localhost:8080/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser01",
  "phone": "13912345678",
  "password": "abc123"
}

### 14. 注册 — 缺少 username
POST http://localhost:8080/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "13911112222",
  "password": "abc123"
}

### 15. 注册 — 缺少 phone
POST http://localhost:8080/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser02",
  "password": "abc123"
}

### 16. 注册 — 缺少 password
POST http://localhost:8080/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser03",
  "phone": "13933334444"
}

### 17. 注册 — 空请求体
POST http://localhost:8080/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 18. 注册 — 手机号格式不正确
POST http://localhost:8080/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser04",
  "phone": "12345",
  "password": "abc123"
}

### 19. 注册 — 密码格式不合法（太短）
POST http://localhost:8080/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser05",
  "phone": "13955556666",
  "password": "123"
}

### 20. 注册 — 手机号已被使用
POST http://localhost:8080/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "dupuser",
  "phone": "13800138000",
  "password": "abc123"
}

### 21. 注册 — username 为空字符串
POST http://localhost:8080/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "",
  "phone": "13977778888",
  "password": "abc123"
}

### 22. 注册 — phone 为空字符串
POST http://localhost:8080/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser06",
  "phone": "",
  "password": "abc123"
}
